{"id":"657545","name":"咸鱼五花肉炖黄豆","author":"jj佳佳","authorId":"8333969","desc":"","cover":"images/657545/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"咸鱼块","amount":"400g"},{"name":"五花肉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"黄豆","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"咸鱼块用温水浸泡15分钟。","img":"images/657545/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"五花肉下油锅煸炒出油脂。","img":"images/657545/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入鱼块翻炒。","img":"images/657545/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再放入葱姜蒜，干辣椒一起翻炒。","img":"images/657545/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"翻炒均匀后放入泡发好的黄豆（黄豆要浸泡10分钟）和清水一起炖20分钟。","img":"images/657545/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"收干汤汁，放入葱花，装盘即可。","img":"images/657545/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}